# Development environments
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Claude Code session worktrees and local settings. A session creates its worktree in the
# current directory, so sometimes inside this one, and each is a full copy of the repository.
# Until this folder became a repository of its own the rule lived in the monorepo's .gitignore,
# a file this repository does not carry.
.claude/

# Node scratch, should a tool under _tools/ ever pull a dependency. They are plain scripts today
# and none of them does.
node_modules/

# The decompilation of Flavor Text's assembly (hekmo), a working tool: it is not redistributable,
# and this repository is public. The folder is absent today, but the rule came over from the
# monorepo so that redoing the decompilation here cannot publish it by accident. What it
# established is written up in the comments of this mod's files.
_tools/src/

# STATUS.md, the sheet that says where this mod stands. It is read by a sweep over every mod rather
# than by asking each session in turn, so it carries working state: what is untested, what is left,
# and the name of the session that holds the mod. That is project bookkeeping, not part of the mod,
# and this repository is public. It stays on disk and out of git, as it was when this folder was a
# directory of the monorepo. Some detached mods track theirs; this one does not.
STATUS.md
